# Credentials and live configuration
**/config.json
**/config.backup.*.json
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/tailscale/authkey.local
**/tailscale-state/*

# TautWeekly for Plex runtime state
**/state.json
**/access-state.json
**/scheduler-state.json
**/scheduler-heartbeat.json
**/service-heartbeat.json
**/configuration-status.json
**/last-run.json
