**/.tautweekly-asset-bundle
**/logs/
**/output/
**/cache/
**/*.log
**/*.log.*

# Persistent Docker data (keep only the directory sentinel)
**/data/*
!**/data/.keep

# Repair/download scratch files
**/assets/*.download

